# ToolkitNetworking - PRD

## Features
- Offline URL request serialization queues.
- `URLProtocol` mocking infrastructure for headless TDD.
- Request deduplication.
- Dynamic request interceptor pipelines.

## Requirements
- Must integrate tightly with TDD workflows to prevent real network calls.
- In-flight simultaneous requests with identical URL/Body/Headers must only trigger 1 external `URLSessionDataTask`.
